oring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder).\n9:**Verdict: PASS.** No active P0, P1 or P2 finding exists. `hasAdvisories` is false.\n15:| Active P2 | 0 |\n22:The reviewed change is two lines of `README.md` (`:269` and `:603`), a complete rename from `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill`. The reviewed blob carries the new name in both places, `origin/main` carries the old one, and every command name the README gives resolves to a file under `.skilled/commands` at the reviewed revision.\n26:PASS routes to `/create:changelog` per the review verdict table; `/speckit:plan` is not triggered. There is no remediation workstream because the area has no active finding: the rename reached both README surfaces and the command tree, and the counts and mode sentences the changed lines sit in are true. A changelog follow-up would only record that pass seven found the docs area clean.\n30:None. The findings registry holds zero open and zero resolved findings, and the three iteration narratives record no finding at any severity.\n38:No spec delta is needed. The reviewed change matches the packet's intent: the command is renamed on every runtime and the root README names the new command. The packet's own spec is unchanged by this review.\n48:| `spec_code` | core | pass | `README.md:269,603` and the reviewed tree's command folder agree; 44 of 44 README command names resolve |\n50:| `skill_agent` | overlay | pass | The command router, its confirm workflow, its presentation contract and the create group index all use `/create:sk-skill` |\n61:- **Pre-existing context, not a branch finding:** `.skilled/commands/local-skilled-alignment.md` is a command file at the commands-tree root. The README's \"Forty-four commands ship in six groups\" is scoped to the six groups, and the README's runtime-goal note at `:613` explains commands that live outside them, so the sentence is accurate at the reviewed revision.\n77:| correctness | 3 | Counts, mode sentence and command behavior verified against the files |\n78:| security | 3 | Changed text is inert; the renamed token is a fixed command name, and the retired name is a fixed mapping |\n96:| evidence | pass | `all-findings-cited` |\n97:| scope | pass | `all-findings-in-scope` |\n105:- `git ls-tree -r --name-only 1c3d62def5a .skilled/commands/create`.\n106:- `.skilled/commands/README.txt:21-35`, `.skilled/commands/create/README.txt:57,88,119-180`, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/README.md:67,194`.\n107:- `.skilled/commands/create/sk-skill.md`, `.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-auto.yaml:113`, `.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-confirm.yaml:30,39-40,626-630`.\n108:- `.opencode/commands/create/*.md` (byte equality), `.claude/commands/create/sk-skill.md` (symlink), `.codex`/`.cursor`/`.pi`/`.dsh`/`.vibe` prompt filenames.\n109:- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:217`, `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:206,251`.\n115:- State: `deep-review-state.jsonl` (gateway projection), `deep-review-findings-registry.json`, `deep-review-dashboard.md`, `deep-review-strategy.md`.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"findings\\\\|P2\\\\|PASS\\\\|CONDITIONAL\\\\|FAIL\\\\|create:sk-skill\\\\|command\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-7/review-report.md | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794833693962,"end":1794833695812}}}}
