{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794833875422,"sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","part":{"partID":"prt_1e46f3c43001478PvlRehX7A3g","sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","messageID":"msg_1e46f3312001csbQi33IWudCxn","type":"tool","id":"call_c6862307bdf94d86bd592f50","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-docs-8\ndescription: Review packet for the pass-eight command-surfacing attach-docs area: the typed-command matcher comment, its suffix tests and the CONTRIBUTING rename.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - attach-docs-8\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n- **Topic:** Review pass eight of the command-surfacing build, area `attach-docs`.\n- **Scope:** the three files named in `review/review-scope-8.txt` under area `attach-docs`, diffed with the scope file's command.\n- **Mode:** review, fan-out lineage, autonomous.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass eight of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, area `attach-docs`: the typed-command matcher comment and suffix tests in the advisor runtime, and this branch's net change to `CONTRIBUTING.md` (the `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` rename).\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The scorer files (`score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`, the routing-accuracy README) belong to the sibling `scorer-8` lineage.\n- The root README rename was reviewed in pass seven by `docs-7`; this pass reads only the `CONTRIBUTING.md` net change.\n- No code, spec, command or document outside the three scope files is modified by this review.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence threshold 0.10 on the severity-weighted new-findings ratio.\n- Maximum 5 iterations.\n- Every configured dimension plus the two required core traceability protocols covered before a legal stop.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Populated during the loop]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\nIteration 1: correctness of the suffix matcher and its tests.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- **Target pointers:** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (lines 197-245, 448-536); `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (lines 396-502); `CONTRIBUTING.md:155`.\n- **Behavior claims:** commit `3416b5e0526` rewords the matcher comment so a `:with-*` modifier typed on any tracked command still names that command; `CONTRIBUTING.md` renames `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill`; every command the file names must exist under `.skilled/commands`.\n- **Reuse and conventions:** the generated `TRACKED_COMMANDS`/`COMMAND_ROWS` tables, the `MODE_SUFFIX` chain constant, the shared `commandOnlyMentioned` mention guard, and the pass-seven review report (`review-report.md`) that recorded the accepted limits.\n- **Review risks and gaps:** the scope diff for the test file is empty at `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526`; the tests were written in phase 038. The recorded limits in `review-brief-8.txt` are not re-reported without a new breaking input. `resource-map.md` is absent, so the Resource Map Coverage Gate is skipped.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[Alignment checks completed across core and overlay protocols]\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-docs-8-1794832880917-x4m8iz, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:57:17Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-docs-8\\ndescription: Review packet for the pass-eight command-surfacing attach-docs area: the typed-command matcher comment, its suffix tests and the CONTRIBUTING rename.\\nimportance_tier: normal\\ncontextType: planning\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - attach-docs-8\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n- **Topic:** Review pass eight of the command-surfacing build, area `attach-docs`.\\n- **Scope:** the three files named in `review/review-scope-8.txt` under area `attach-docs`, diffed with the scope file's command.\\n- **Mode:** review, fan-out lineage, autonomous.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass eight of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, area `attach-docs`: the typed-command matcher comment and suffix tests in the advisor runtime, and this branch's net change to `CONTRIBUTING.md` (the `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` rename).\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The scorer files (`score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`, the routing-accuracy README) belong to the sibling `scorer-8` lineage.\\n- The root README rename was reviewed in pass seven by `docs-7`; this pass reads only the `CONTRIBUTING.md` net change.\\n- No code, spec, command or document outside the three scope files is modified by this review.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence threshold 0.10 on the severity-weighted new-findings ratio.\\n- Maximum 5 iterations.\\n- Every configured dimension plus the two required core traceability protocols covered before a legal stop.\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Populated during the loop]\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\nIteration 1: correctness of the suffix matcher and its tests.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- **Target pointers:** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (lines 197-245, 448-536); `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (lines 396-502); `CONTRIBUTING.md:155`.\\n- **Behavior claims:** commit `3416b5e0526` rewords the matcher comment so a `:with-*` modifier typed on any tracked command still names that command; `CONTRIBUTING.md` renames `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill`; every command the file names must exist under `.skilled/commands`.\\n- **Reuse and conventions:** the generated `TRACKED_COMMANDS`/`COMMAND_ROWS` tables, the `MODE_SUFFIX` chain constant, the shared `commandOnlyMentioned` mention guard, and the pass-seven review report (`review-report.md`) that recorded the accepted limits.\\n- **Review risks and gaps:** the scope diff for the test file is empty at `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526`; the tests were written in phase 038. The recorded limits in `review-brief-8.txt` are not re-reported without a new breaking input. `resource-map.md` is absent, so the Resource Map Coverage Gate is skipped.\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[Alignment checks completed across core and overlay protocols]\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 5\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-docs-8-179