{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794834095728,"sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","part":{"partID":"prt_1e472d210001nfVC3o2x6Yc2em","sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","messageID":"msg_1e472be44001AYajCKbQ0ttQUu","type":"tool","id":"call_ff47d66f6db046b5b7fd02ee","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n- A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\n- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.","oldString":"- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -52,12 +52,15 @@\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n - Direct diff read of `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526` plus a source-reproduced matcher probe: it showed the reworded comment matches the shared suffix union and that every REQ-003 input still resolves. (iteration 1)\n - Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n+- A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\n+- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n+- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n ## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n ### A documented suffix the matcher refuses: the sweep of all 46 argument hints found no token outside the seven-word set, the same union phase 038's `spec_code` check recorded. -- BLOCKED (iteration 2, 1 attempts)\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\\n- A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\\n- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\",\"oldString\":\"- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794834092560,"end":1794834095728}}}}
