\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a suffix that escapes the no-edit gate\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"attachCommand consults isNoEditRequest first; a suffix-bearing no-edit prompt returns undefined\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a suffix that promotes a non-owner command\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"the owner check runs on the mapped name after typedCommandIn returns, so a non-owner top skill still withholds it\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a new exposure from the retired map\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"the map is fixed data and the question/refusal behavior is the phase 020 accepted limit\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794834148263,"end":1794834156832}}}}
