{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794834172313,"sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","part":{"partID":"prt_1e4740377001xSZwc6jt2WSSjv","sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c05ffe74nsIz5B1nhkxa","messageID":"msg_1e473f500001eHU9RX6te3Is6A","type":"tool","id":"call_d50519ad3f89497db2b4e47d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md; echo \"=== worked\"; sed -n '/## 8. WHAT WORKED/,/## 9. EXHAUSTED/p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md | head -20"},"output":"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: maintainability - Focus area: the comment's accuracy against the tests, the `:with-phases` test gap, and the documentation quality of the changed `CONTRIBUTING.md` sentence. - Reason: security is clean; maintainability is the last uncovered dimension and the place the reworded comment and its tests belong. - Rotation status: correctness, traceability and security complete; maintainability remaining. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: none blocked; the no-edit probe and the constant-table read were productive. - Required evidence: every claim in the comment has a matching test, or the gap is recorded with its reach. Review verdict: PASS\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n=== worked\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Direct diff read of `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526` plus a source-reproduced matcher probe: it showed the reworded comment matches the shared suffix union and that every REQ-003 input still resolves. (iteration 1)\n- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n- A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\n- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: maintainability - Focus area: the comment's accuracy against the tests, the `:with-phases` test gap, and the documentation quality of the changed `CONTRIBUTING.md` sentence. - Reason: security is clean; maintainability is the last uncovered dimension and the place the reworded comment and its tests belong. - Rotation status: correctness, traceability and security complete; maintainability remaining. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: none blocked; the no-edit probe and the constant-table read were productive. - Required evidence: every claim in the comment has a matching test, or the gap is recorded with its reach. Review verdict: PASS\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n=== worked\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Direct diff read of `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526` plus a source-reproduced matcher probe: it showed the reworded comment matches the shared suffix union and that every REQ-003 input still resolves. (iteration 1)\n- Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n- A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\n- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md; echo \\\"=== worked\\\"; sed -n '/## 8. WHAT WORKED/,/## 9. EXHAUSTED/p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794834170743,"end":1794834172313}}}}
