:[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -54,13 +54,16 @@\n - Direct diff read of `1c3d62def5a..3416b5e0526` plus a source-reproduced matcher probe: it showed the reworded comment matches the shared suffix union and that every REQ-003 input still resolves. (iteration 1)\n - Reading the command argument hints as context, rather than treating the comment as the specification: it separated a comment-accuracy question from a behavior question. (iteration 1)\n - A scripted sweep of every `argument-hint` under `.skilled/commands` (46 files): it proved the matcher's seven-token set is exactly the documented union, with no undetected suffix. (iteration 2)\n - Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n+- Probing the no-edit gate with a suffix-bearing prompt: it showed the gate is consulted before the suffix branch and still returns no command. (iteration 3)\n+- Reading the module's import list and every constant table: it confirmed the matcher has no I/O, environment or dynamic-pattern surface. (iteration 3)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n - Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\n+- Nothing failed in iteration 3. Every security probe was deterministic and no exposure was found.\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n ## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n ### A documented suffix the matcher refuses: the sweep of all 46 argument hints found no token outside the seven-word set, the same union phase 038's `spec_code` check recorded. -- BLOCKED (iteration 2, 1 attempts)\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\\n- Probing the no-edit gate with a suffix-bearing prompt: it showed the gate is consulted before the suffix branch and still returns no command. (iteration 3)\\n- Reading the module's import list and every constant table: it confirmed the matcher has no I/O, environment or dynamic-pattern surface. (iteration 3)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 2. Every named command and suffix token resolved on the first check.\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 3. Every security probe was deterministic and no exposure was found.\",\"oldString\":\"- Comparing `origin/main` to `HEAD` for `CONTRIBUTING.md` rather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\\n- Nothing fa