ather than reading the working file alone: it isolated the one-line rename and showed no stale occurrence remains. (iteration 2)\n - Probing the no-edit gate with a suffix-bearing prompt: it showed the gate is consulted before the suffix branch and still returns no command. (iteration 3)\n - Reading the module's import list and every constant table: it confirmed the matcher has no I/O, environment or dynamic-pattern surface. (iteration 3)\n - Grepping the test file for every `:with-*` token, rather than assuming the \"with-modifier\" test covered all three: it found `:with-phases` absent and turned the gap into one actionable P2. (iteration 4)\n+- Re-reading the active P2's cited lines in the stability pass: it confirmed the finding is unchanged and correctly placed, and that no new finding appeared. (iteration 5)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Nothing failed in iteration 1. The behavioral probes were all deterministic and the diff was a one-paragraph comment change.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-docs-8/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Grepping the test file for every `:with-*` token, rather than assuming the \\\"with-modifier\\\" test covered all three: it found `:with-phases` absent and turned the gap into one actionable P2. (iteration 4)\\n- Re-reading the active P2's cited lines in the stability pass: it confirmed the finding is unchanged and correctly placed, and that no new finding appeared. (iteration 5)\",\"oldString\":\"- Grepping the test file for every `:with-*` token, rather than assuming the \\\"with-modifier\\\" test covered all three: it found `:with-phases` absent and turned the gap into one actionable P2. (iteration 4)\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routi